# provenance: flext-ldif FlextLdif().migration_pipeline oid->oud base_dn=dc=ctbc output of acl_synth_input.ldif (sha256=72871129f755f6e3f7f854b5f707e60d4a39d838dc1cbfd9f99e2ff4a0c0cb8f); flext-ws7iv semantics: union of grants minus denials per ACI (OID-30 30.1.6.2), denials rendered as OUD deny (OUD 9.1.4); regenerate on any intended conversion change
