aci: (targetattr="objectclass")(version 3.0; acl "orclaci 1.2 R4e"; allow (read,search) userdn="ldap:///self";)
aci: (targetattr="*")(targetscope="subordinate")(version 3.0; acl "orclaci 1.3 R5"; deny (add) (userdn="ldap:///anyone" and not groupdn="ldap:///cn=SecurityAdmins,dc=ctbc");)
aci: (targetattr="*")(version 3.0; acl "orclaci 1.3 R5"; deny (delete) (userdn="ldap:///anyone" and not groupdn="ldap:///cn=SecurityAdmins,dc=ctbc");)
